Subject: [PATCH] build: align Chronik CXX runtime and generator at 1.0.161

fixup! [chronik] Bump the build to c++20

Align the inherited CXX runtime/build/macro/flags/command family at minimal release1.0.161. It removes the two invalid automatically_derived annotations on inherent impls that produce22 strict Clippy errors with the prescribed Rust1.93 toolchain. The five unrelated Windows dependency-edge rewrites from Cargo resolution are restored. No bridge source, lint suppression, MSRV, transaction or consensus change.

Official provenance: https://github.com/dtolnay/cxx/releases/tag/1.0.161 (PR1537), MSRV1.73. Full configured Chronik strict Clippy and134tests now pass after separately owned authored-code lint repairs. Production CXX helper/Rust release ABI closure rebuild remains required.

Tier: eCash (fixup to inherited upstream4251281196 [chronik] Bump the build to c++20; outside301, requires explicit shared build compatibility placement)

The original fixup subject above is author provenance; pinned ABC inherited that generator family, so this compatibility upgrade remains an independent shared purpose.

Coordinator integration provenance (reference405):
0040-cxx161-build-family.patch: Independent upstream CXX1.0.161 compatibility, not introduced by a maintained owner.
